    new "¡Pasa por delante los hombres!"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_AltInvestigation.rpy:359
    old "Why go through all these loops if you just wanted me to kill them?"
    new "¿Por qué pasar por todos estos lios si lo único que querías era matarlos?"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_AltInvestigation.rpy:359
    old "Don't you have a uniform to wear?"
    new "¿No tienes un uniforme para usar?"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_AltInvestigation.rpy:359
