    new "Nuestras manos..."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_AltInvestigation.rpy:110
    old "...Were unbroken..."
    new "...Fueron inquebrantables..."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_AltInvestigation.rpy:110
